dpoint%22%3A%7B%22playlistId%22%3A%22WL%22%2C%22actions%22%3A%5B%7B%22action%22%3A%22ACTION_REMOVE_VIDEO_BY_VIDEO_ID%22%2C%22removedVideoId%22%3A%221MpIvfzTOa0%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%7D%7D%7D%2C%22microformat%22%3A%7B%22playerMicroformatRenderer%22%3A%7B%22thumbnail%22%3A%7B%22thumbnails%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F1MpIvfzTOa0%2Fmaxresdefault.jpg%22%2C%22width%22%3A1280%2C%22height%22%3A720%7D%5D%7D%2C%22embed%22%3A%7B%22iframeUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2F1MpIvfzTOa0%22%2C%22width%22%3A1280%2C%22height%22%3A720%7D%2C%22title%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Oliver%27s+Money+Logic%22%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22We+all+have+our+own+unique+money+logic.+With+the+Wells+Fargo%C2%AE+Mobile+App%2C+it%E2%80%99s+easy+for+Oliver+to+track+his+savings.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5CnLearn+more+at+https%3A%2F%2Fwelcome.wf.com%2Fmoneysmart%2F%3Ffocus%3Dsavings%5Cu0026utm_campaign%3D26_pcm_cons_uf_en%5Cu0026utm_source%3Dyoutube%5Cu0026utm_medium%3Dorganicvideo%5Cu0026utm_content%3Doliversavings15+%5Cn+%5CnTranscript%3A+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Banking%2C+specifically+the+ability+to+track+savings+goals+in+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app.+This+video+features+a+man%2C+Oliver%2C+eating+a+sandwich+in+his+parked+car+outside+the+stadium+as+spectators+walk+in+around+him.+Oliver+reminds+himself+that+he%E2%80%99s+saving+up+for+his+%E2%80%98Playoffs+fund%E2%80%99+which+is+why+he+opts+to+eat+before+the+game+to+save+money.%5D++%5Cn++%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+a+man%2C+Oliver%2C+in+a+car.+He%E2%80%99s+eating+a+delicious+looking+gourmet+sandwich+with+mozzarella+and+prosciutto+on+focaccia.%5D+%5Cn++%5CnVO%3A+To+Oliver%2C+eating+here+instead+of+buying+a+stadium+hot+dog%2C+is+like+putting+away+20+bucks.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOliver+picks+up+his+phone.+He+has+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app+open+with+his+%E2%80%98Playoffs+fund%E2%80%99+savings+goal+opened.+He+has+saved+%24580+so+far+and+still+has+%241%2C420+to+go+to+reach+the+%242%2C000+goal+he+has+set+for+himself.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn++%5CnScreen+images+simulated.+Availability+may+be+affected+by+your+mobile+carrier%E2%80%99s+coverage+area.+Message+and+data+rates+may+apply.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+With+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app%E2%80%A6tracking+his+savings+is+simple.+%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+to+his+friends+outside+and+a+tiny+bit+of+arugula+and+pesto+falls+out+of+the+sandwich+and+onto+his+lap.%5D+%5Cn++%5CnVO%3A+Whoops.++%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOliver+looks+down+and+wipes+it+off.%5D+%5Cn+++%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn++%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%7D%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A16%2C%22ownerProfileUrl%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40wellsfargo%22%2C%22externalChannelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isFamilySafe%22%3Afalse%2C%22availableCountries%22%3A%5B%22AD%22%2C%22AE%22%2C%22AF%22%2C%22AG%22%2C%22AI%22%2C%22AL%22%2C%22AM%22%2C%22AO%22%2C%22AQ%22%2C%22AR%22%2C%22AS%22%2C%22AT%22%2C%22AU%22%2C%22AW%22%2C%22AX%22%2C%22AZ%22%2C%22BA%22%2C%22BB%22%2C%22BD%22%2C%22BE%22%2C%22BF%22%2C%22BG%22%2C%22BH%22%2C%22BI%22%2C%22BJ%22%2C%22BL%22%2C%22BM%22%2C%22BN%22%2C%22BO%22%2C%22BQ%22%2C%22BR%22%2C%22BS%22%2C%22BT%22%2C%22BV%22%2C%22BW%22%2C%22BY%22%2C%22BZ%22%2C%22CA%22%2C%22CC%22%2C%22CD%22%2C%22CF%22%2C%22CG%22%2C%22CH%22%2C%22CI%22%2C%22CK%22%2C%22CL%22%2C%22CM%22%2C%22CN%22%2C%22CO%22%2C%22CR%22%2C%22CU%22%2C%22CV%22%2C%22CW%22%2C%22CX%22%2C%22CY%22%2C%22CZ%22%2C%22DE%22%2C%22DJ%22%2C%22DK%22%2C%22DM%22%2C%22DO%22%2C%22DZ%22%2C%22EC%22%2C%22EE%22%2C%22EG%22%2C%22EH%22%2C%22ER%22%2C%22ES%22%2C%22ET%22%2C%22FI%22%2C%22FJ%22%2C%22FK%22%2C%22FM%22%2C%22FO%22%2C%22FR%22%2C%22GA%22%2C%22GB%22%2C%22GD%22%2C%22GE%22%2C%22GF%22%2C%22GG%22%2C%22GH%22%2C%22GI%22%2C%22GL%22%2C%22GM%22%2C%22GN%22%2C%22GP%22%2C%22GQ%22%2C%22GR%22%2C%22GS%22%2C%22GT%22%2C%22GU%22%2C%22GW%22%2C%22GY%22%2C%22HK%22%2C%22HM%22%2C%22HN%22%2C%22HR%22%2C