selection video for Gameweek 1 for the 2026/27 Premier League season!\n\nIn this video we take a look at Gianni Butticè's team, a manager who has used data and analytics to improve his rank over the past few years. He boasts 7x top 25k finishes, has written a book about FPL, and is known for his maverick style. He's a unique manager, and one of my favourite FPL content creators, so make sure you go check him out!\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":32,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwjV7PyP8quWAxVDLLMFHYdiLxlIrq-x6I6wg9JdygEEM9gjbA==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU05FM2F0YWhiWUg5OFNua1Vpc011RXxBR3JiS2FuNjkwWjdKdmdpa0tPSU1rNVlUZ3BNcXVqbVh2bk5IVi01dlNQaDNrUk8yc1ZSR0xmeFhhczRjOUZQcTRRd3M2ZTQxUmxYZ1RmUmtVUXN1UE54VnE2YTlZLUFIT0V3\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Fai-team-rating%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dteam-rating%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=XaQNgO0MV64","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU05FM2F0YWhiWUg5OFNua1Vpc011RXxBR3JiS2FuNjkwWjdKdmdpa0tPSU1rNVlUZ3BNcXVqbVh2bk5IVi01dlNQaDNrUk8yc1ZSR0xmeFhhczRjOUZQcTRRd3M2ZTQxUmxYZ1RmUmtVUXN1UE54VnE2YTlZLUFIT0V3\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Fai-team-rating%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dteam-rating%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=XaQNgO0MV64","target":"TARGET_NEW